* November 1st - '''BESTIA''' sign [[Chuky]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+Chuky AC">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/bestia_corp/status/1719784282309194186|title=¡Bienvenido, @chukycsgo!|trans_title=Welcome, @chukycsgo!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2023-11-01|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>

|content2=
