* November 1st - '''BESTIA''' loan [[meyern]] to [[Bounty Hunters Esports]]. <ref name="meyern loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bhbountyhunters/status/1852387213536800956|title=MEYERN CHEGOU NA SUA BH!|trans_title=MEYERN HAS ARRIVED IN YOUR BH!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-11-01|author=[[Bounty Hunters Esports]]}}</ref>
