* December 13rd - '''BESTIA''' bench [[zock (Uruguayan player)|zock]]. <ref name="zock bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1867586656196514202|title=A partir de hoy, Mauro "zock" Da Silva pasará al banco del roster de CS2 Main y está habilitado a recibir ofertas|trans_title=Starting today, Mauro "zock" Da Silva will move to the bench of the CS2 Main roster and is eligible to receive offers|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2024-12-13|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>

