* February 25th - '''BESTIA''' bench [[naz]] and acquire [[leo_drk]] and [[cass1n]] from [[Hype Esports]] and [[paiN Gaming]], respectively. <ref name="naz bench>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1894426347742629948|title=Comunicado oficial|trans_title=Official statement|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-02-25|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref><ref name="+leo_drk>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1894406278920687767|title=¡BIENVENIDO, @leo_drunky!|trans_title=WELCOME, @leo_drunky!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-02-25|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref><ref name="+cass1n>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1894481231439692026|title=¡@cass1n_ ES UNA BESTIA!|trans_title=@cass1n_ IS A BEAST!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-02-25|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* March 21st - '''BESTIA''' part ways with [[leo_drk]]. <ref name="-leo_drk>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1903122281246622102|title=Desde BESTIA queremos informar nuestro jugador Leonel "leo_drk" de Oliveira dejará de formar parte del equipo titular de CS2|trans_title=From BESTIA we want to inform you that our player Leonel "leo_drk" de Oliveira will no longer be part of the CS2 starting team|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-03-21|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* March 24th - '''BESTIA''' acquire [[timo]] from [[VELOX Argentina]]. <ref name="+timo>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1904277090481872929|title=¡Bienvenido a tu nueva casa, TIMO!|trans_title=Welcome to your new home, TIMO!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-03-24|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* March 25th - '''BESTIA''' release [[naz]]. <ref name="-naz>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1904646977796923845|title=¡HASTA PRONTO NAZ!|trans_title=SEE YOU SOON NAZ!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-03-25|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* November 13th - '''BESTIA''' part ways with [[luchov]] and sign [[buda]] as his replacement. <ref name="-luchov">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1989045420681752732|title=Hoy toca separar caminos|trans_title=Today it's time to separate paths|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-11-13|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref><ref name="+buda">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/1989079518062211523|title=¡BIENVENIDO, @budafps!|trans_title=Welcome, @budafps!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2025-11-13|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* February 9th - '''BESTIA''' bench [[timo]]. <ref name="timo bench>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2020966200579084659|title=Comunicado oficial|trans_title=Official statement|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-02-09|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* February 13th - '''BESTIA''' sign [[nacho]] to complete their lineup. <ref name="+nacho">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2022328378721005745|title=¡BIENVENIDO @nachocsg0!|trans_title=Welcome, @nachocsg0!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-02-13|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* February 16th - [[timo]] is loaned to [[Isurus]]. <ref name="timo isurus">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2023500188607025339|title=Muchos éxitos con el tiburón @uytimo|trans_title=Best of luck with the shark! @uytimo|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-02-16|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* February 18th - '''BESTIA''' shuffle their coaching staff, with [[Zote]] transitioning to an assistant coach role while [[pino]] becomes the team's head coach. Additionally, they sign [[shaRpy]] as an analyst and [[TecTH0R]] as a manager. <ref name="2026 staff changes">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2024247303637205204|title=ACTUALIZACIÓN DE STAFF|trans_title=STAFF UPDATE|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-02-18|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* March 8th - '''BESTIA''' bench [[Noktse]] and [[pino]]. <ref name="Noktse pino bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2030815056905068620|title=Después de tres años compartidos y de muchos momentos hermosos vividos, hoy nos toca despedir a dos piezas fundamentales que estuvieron desde el día cero: Nicolás @noktseCS Dávila y Rodrigo @pino_csgo Manarino|trans_title=After three years together and many beautiful moments, today we say goodbye to two fundamental members who were there from day one: Nicolás @noktseCS Dávila and Rodrigo @pino_csgo Manarino|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-03-08|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* March 11th - '''BESTIA''' recall [[timo]] from his loan to [[Isurus]] and promote [[shaRpy]] to head coach. <ref name="timo return">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2031784515341898045|title=REESTRUCTURACIÓN DEL EQUIPO|trans_title=TEAM RESTRUCTURING|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-03-11|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* June 9th - '''BESTIA''' part ways with [[pino]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-pino">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/pinobili/status/2064387471564042620|title=Quería informar la finalización de mi vinculo contractual con Bestia|trans_title=I would like to announce the end of my contract with Bestia|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-06-09|author=[[pino]]}}</ref>
* June 22nd - '''BESTIA''' part ways with [[Noktse]] following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-Noktse">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/noktseCS/status/2069154665552576941|title=Hoy finaliza mi contrato con @bestia_corp y paso a ser oficialmente Free Agent|trans_title=My contract with @bestia_corp ends today, and I am officially a Free Agent|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-06-22|author=[[Noktse]]}}</ref>
* July 22nd - '''BESTIA''' transition [[shaRpy]] into an assistant coach role and sign [[tge]] as his replacement. <ref name="staff change +tge">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2031784515341898045|title=¡BIENVENIDO @tgefps!|trans_title=WELCOME @tgefps!|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-07-22|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''BESTIA''' bench [[nacho]]. <ref name="nacho bench>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2089467171088765369|title=Comunicado oficial|trans_title=Official statement|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-08-17|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* August 18th - '''BESTIA''' part ways with [[Zote]]. <ref name="-zote">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2089870223587291406|title=Hoy nos despedimos de @zotefps|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @zotefps|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-08-18|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* August 25th - '''BESTIA''' part ways with [[tomaszin]]. <ref name="-tomaszin">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2092355672855728488|title=Hay jugadores que dejan huella para toda la vida y sin dudas Tomaszin es uno de ellos|trans_title=There are players who leave a lifelong mark, and without a doubt, Tomaszin is one of them|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-08-25|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
* September 9th - '''BESTIA''' sign [[drop]] and acquire [[kauez]] on loan from [[paiN Gaming]] until the end of the year. <ref name="+drop; +kauez>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/bestia_corp/status/2097521688158068912|title=Le damos la bienvenida a drop y kauez, que se suman al roster de CS2|trans_title=We welcome drop and kauez, who are joining the CS2 roster|language={{Flag|ar}} Spanish|date=2026-09-09|author='''BESTIA'''}}</ref>
}}

