'''BOSS''' was an organization-less [[:Category:United States|American]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team that initially formed after [[Wildcard Gaming]] parted ways with the core of their first lineup. Its second iteration was formed after [[BLUEJAYS]] parted ways with the core of their North American roster.

