|This=3

|content1=
* August 8th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' enter [[Counter-Strike 2]] by signing [[brazylijski luz]], a lineup consisting of [[Qlocuu]], [[POLO]], [[Prism]], [[swiz]], and [[virtuoso]]. Additionally, they sign [[Bogdan]] as coach. <ref name="+luz">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1821592257931420019|title=Wakacje się skończyły|trans_title=The vacations are over|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2024-08-08|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 17th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' bench [[POLO]]. <ref name="polo bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/betclicapogee/status/1846959457018040768|title=Z dniem dzisiejszym @cs2POLO zostaje przesunięty na ławkę rezerwowych|trans_title=As of today @cs2POLO is moved to the reserve bench|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2024-10-17|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 20th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' bench [[Qlocuu]], [[swiz]], and [[virtuoso]]. <ref name="bench trio">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1859310987624714290|title=Our first chapter in CS comes to an end...|date=2025-11-20|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 21st - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' sign [[hypex]], [[Demho]], [[hfah]], and [[jcobbb]]. <ref name="+quartet">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1859628122779377721|title=Announcing our New CS2 Roster!|date=2024-11-21|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* December 31st - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' release [[POLO]], [[Qlocuu]], [[swiz]], and [[virtuoso]] upon the expiration of their contracts. <ref name="released">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/qlocuu/status/1870889231310057895|title=At the end of the year our contract with Betclic Apogee will be ending|date=2024-12-22|author=[[Qlocuu]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* July 10th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' bench [[hfah]] and sign [[dycha]] as his replacement. <ref name="bench hfah">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1943245059018641593|title=From today, Oskar @hfah272 Wroński is no longer part of our starting lineup|date=2025-07-10|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+dycha">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1943251350260789497|title=Guess who's back|date=2025-07-10|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 22nd - [[jcobbb]] is acquired by [[FaZe Clan]]. <ref name="-jcobbb">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1958797537605034289|title=Today, we would like to announce the transfer of @1jcobbb|date=2025-08-22|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 5th - [[hfah]] is loaned to [[Team Venom]]. <ref name="hfah loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/vnm_cs/status/1963912004512395730|title=KOLESIE → Team Venom|date=2025-09-05|author=[[Team Venom]]}}</ref>
* September 8th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' sign [[misho]] as an analyst. <ref name="+misho analyst">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1965059122967269452|title=Pora ogłosić nowy nabytek do drużyny|trans_title=It's time to announce a new addition to the team|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2025-09-08|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* September 13th - [[hypex]] is acquired by an undisclosed organization, later revealed to be [[GamerLegion]]. <ref name="-hypex">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1966933667999256597|title=We would like to announce that today @hypexxcs was bought out by a tier 1 team|date=2025-09-13|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* October 1st - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' sign [[Melavi]] from [[Anonymo Esports]]. <ref name="+melavi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1973393119149269233|title=Another yologang420 GOAT joins the game|date=2025-10-01|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* November 28th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' bench [[Melavi]]. <ref name="melavi bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/1994482704318878172|title=Today we announce that @Melavi0 has been moved to the bench|date=2025-11-28|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* December 11th - [[hfah]] returns to the bench following the end of his loan to [[Team Venom]]. <ref name="hfah return">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/vnm_cs/status/1999126146995113992|title=Nadchodzi koniec roku, a wraz z nim koniec okresu wypożyczenia @hfah272 z @BetclicApogee|trans_title=The end of the year is approaching, and with it the end of @hfah272's loan spell from @BetclicApogee|language={{Flag|pl}} Polish|date=2025-12-11|author=[[Team Venom]]}}</ref>
