|content3=
* January 9th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' acquire [[hades]] from [[Inner Circle Esports]] and [[eskyy]] from [[TNC Esports]] and sign [[Dr3nquu]]. <ref name="2026 roster">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2009611153006084519|title=CHAPTER 3 BEGINS|date=2026-01-09|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
