* April 20th - [[Bogdan]] signs a long-term contract extension with '''Betclic Apogee Esports'''. <ref name="bogdan contract">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/betclicapogee/status/2046227490830528986|title=Someone has to yell at them bots|date=2026-04-20|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* April 22nd - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' sign [[nawrot]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+nawrot">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2046952322513707399|title=Time to make things serious|date=2026-04-22|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* June 19th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' part ways with [[eskyy]]. <ref name="-eskyy">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2067955614144217321|title=Hello, today we're bringing you some announcements|date=2026-06-19|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 4th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' part ways with [[nawrot]]. <ref name="-nawrot">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2073406485481070940|title=Today we bid farewell to @nawrot_cs|date=2026-07-04|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 9th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' bench [[Dr3nquu]] and part ways with [[hades]] and [[misho]]. <ref name="Dr3nquu bench">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2075264971055726621|title=Continuing our updates, @Dr3nquu is being moved to the bench|date=2026-07-09|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="-hades">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2075263712911327486|title=Today we bid farewell to @hadesCS2|date=2026-07-09|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="-misho">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2075266228873310288|title=To wrap up today's announcements, we'd like to let you know that our analyst, @mishoCS2, is also leaving our team|date=2026-07-09|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 10th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' part ways with [[Bogdan]]. <ref name="-Bogdan">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2075611200230973510|title=THANK YOU BOGDAN|date=2026-07-10|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 22nd - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' sign [[Qlocuu]], [[Ex1st]], and [[SZPERO]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="new apogee">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2079914516398104596|title=Introducing the new Betclic Apogee|date=2026-07-22|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* July 28th - [[Prism]] and [[Demho]] sign contract extensions with '''Betclic Apogee Esports'''. <ref>{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2082103813402485190|title=We are thrilled to announce that Wojciech @Prismiwnl Zięba and Patryk @DemhoH Tomaszewski are extending their contracts|date=2026-07-28|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
* August 11th - '''Betclic Apogee Esports''' acquire [[ultimate]] from [[Team Liquid]] to complete their roster. <ref name="+ultimate">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/BetclicApogee/status/2087207700450910399|title=ROLAND BACK IN POLAND|date=2026-08-11|author='''Betclic Apogee Esports'''}}</ref>
}}

